{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Bea prepares to become the 7th <strong>Starbug Trooper</strong>, the ceremony is interrupted by an attack.\u00a0<strong>The 4 Horseflies of the Apocalypse</strong>  return after years of absence. Bea must unite all the Starbug Troopers to put an end to the schemes of <strong>Lies, Famine, Plague, and Conquest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/587ce497dbf58531f249e6913b78a930.avif?t=1767628911\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras_big/587ce497dbf58531f249e6913b78a930.avif?t=1767628911 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ORIGINAL BLEND OF GENRES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the adventures of Bea and the other Starbug Troopers in a humorous journey that mixes strategy and action. <strong>Outsmart your opponent</strong> by positioning your troops to your advantage and gain the upper hand. Or perhaps you'd prefer to <strong>outpace them</strong>, using your reflexes and agility to destroy all their ships.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A STRATEGY BASED ON SUPPORT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your chances of victory in combat : position your troops relative to each other to <strong>gain greater support than your opponent</strong> and stack the odds in your favor during battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/2a831ff41e2a288f07f535f5eb59992f.poster.avif?t=1767628911\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/2a831ff41e2a288f07f535f5eb59992f.webm?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/2a831ff41e2a288f07f535f5eb59992f.mp4?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINI SHIPS, MAXI COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments at the scale of an insect. Carve your way through tall grass, navigate upstream rivers, or delve into a mysterious cavern in search of your opponents, <strong>destroying their ships before they find you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/b1b4fc41b8429cf621c4065bdb353db0.poster.avif?t=1767628911\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/b1b4fc41b8429cf621c4065bdb353db0.webm?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/b1b4fc41b8429cf621c4065bdb353db0.mp4?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECRUIT YOUR TROOPS FROM 7 UNIQUE SHIP TYPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven unique insect-ships are available</strong>. Fighter, healer, bomber... Each ship has its own role and unique abilities. It\u2019s up to you to recruit the right ships to lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/0b01e19cd91e521d46a8531c4a0defa2.poster.avif?t=1767628911\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/0b01e19cd91e521d46a8531c4a0defa2.webm?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/0b01e19cd91e521d46a8531c4a0defa2.mp4?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKIRMISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come discover the brand-new Skirmish mode<br>\u00b7 Random map generation, in the size of your choice<br>\u00b7 Select up to 6 enemies<br>\u00b7 Battle in one of the game\u2019s four original environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 then start again on a new map, for endless replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic journey into the heart of the first green space opera.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Insecticide 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/803ea16d92f4dce3136614e3fd3a99a3ff9bcde5.jpg"},{"name":"Insecticide 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/a4124668db6856902b958426083078ace015a826.jpg"},{"name":"Insecticide 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/25c32e6019aa0ee479435c8d5bbc8e8b3b636ebd.jpg"},{"name":"Sniper shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/2cbeaba8147546f41db1c7b051a50c09beced8e0.jpg"},{"name":"Expose the truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/655aeb6d55b970fe6f5ee8eb717dd73f18e9817e.jpg"},{"name":"Mass vaccination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/0f5d9ffdb25d9900ff05e25f5a23c127d4280691.jpg"},{"name":"He\u2019s gonna eat it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/99f05cee8047ada26f7e99eeaaa1e69ba1af8b10.jpg"},{"name":"At last, some peace!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/234bb10809dc2fd3679962bd7552cdfb51191883.jpg"},{"name":"Ladybug net","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/80a3416f0c5a1037b6492d3b1fb25acf4e121e2c.jpg"},{"name":"She picks things up quickly!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3160110/11b85426669b3f30ce599bf69f48024ef15815c8.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160110?t=1767628911","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3160110?t=1767628911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/07cafdf039e65b3f3dcc5ae7bbbcbf77e58ea2e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767628911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/07cafdf039e65b3f3dcc5ae7bbbcbf77e58ea2e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767628911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Bea prepares to become the 7th <strong>Starbug Trooper</strong>, the ceremony is interrupted by an attack.\u00a0<strong>The 4 Horseflies of the Apocalypse</strong>  return after years of absence. Bea must unite all the Starbug Troopers to put an end to the schemes of <strong>Lies, Famine, Plague, and Conquest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/587ce497dbf58531f249e6913b78a930.avif?t=1767628911\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras_big/587ce497dbf58531f249e6913b78a930.avif?t=1767628911 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ORIGINAL BLEND OF GENRES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the adventures of Bea and the other Starbug Troopers in a humorous journey that mixes strategy and action. <strong>Outsmart your opponent</strong> by positioning your troops to your advantage and gain the upper hand. Or perhaps you'd prefer to <strong>outpace them</strong>, using your reflexes and agility to destroy all their ships.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A STRATEGY BASED ON SUPPORT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your chances of victory in combat : position your troops relative to each other to <strong>gain greater support than your opponent</strong> and stack the odds in your favor during battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/2a831ff41e2a288f07f535f5eb59992f.poster.avif?t=1767628911\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/2a831ff41e2a288f07f535f5eb59992f.webm?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/2a831ff41e2a288f07f535f5eb59992f.mp4?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINI SHIPS, MAXI COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments at the scale of an insect. Carve your way through tall grass, navigate upstream rivers, or delve into a mysterious cavern in search of your opponents, <strong>destroying their ships before they find you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/b1b4fc41b8429cf621c4065bdb353db0.poster.avif?t=1767628911\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/b1b4fc41b8429cf621c4065bdb353db0.webm?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/b1b4fc41b8429cf621c4065bdb353db0.mp4?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECRUIT YOUR TROOPS FROM 7 UNIQUE SHIP TYPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seven unique insect-ships are available</strong>. Fighter, healer, bomber... Each ship has its own role and unique abilities. It\u2019s up to you to recruit the right ships to lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/0b01e19cd91e521d46a8531c4a0defa2.poster.avif?t=1767628911\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/0b01e19cd91e521d46a8531c4a0defa2.webm?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/extras/0b01e19cd91e521d46a8531c4a0defa2.mp4?t=1767628911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKIRMISH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come discover the brand-new Skirmish mode<br>\u00b7 Random map generation, in the size of your choice<br>\u00b7 Select up to 6 enemies<br>\u00b7 Battle in one of the game\u2019s four original environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 then start again on a new map, for endless replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic journey into the heart of the first green space opera.</p>","developers":["Big Loot Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160110/a3aec11c5cf5c3cd5e37d006b73193ce3ddb7cf4/header.jpg?t=1767628911","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong